WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:12.258
Welcome to the Tamil Nadu NEET 720 Mastery Hub — built to turn every Tamil Nadu student's medical dream into reality.

2
00:00:12.508 --> 00:00:27.490
Securing a seat in top Government Medical Colleges like MMC requires more than memorization — it demands deep NCERT mastery and precision OMR practice.

3
00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:39.782
That is why this platform combines 7,484 verified NEET questions with a live bilingual Tamil and English Gemini AI Coach.

4
00:00:40.032 --> 00:00:52.524
In Tab 1 — the Exam Workspace — you can take full-length Mock Exams following NTA's strict 180-question, 180-minute compulsory pattern.

5
00:00:52.774 --> 00:01:03.796
Switch any question instantly between English, Tamil, or Bilingual view, while tracking every bubble on the live NTA OMR sheet on the left.

6
00:01:04.046 --> 00:01:13.760
Filter seamlessly across Physics, Chemistry, Botany, and Zoology, mark questions for review, and master real exam time management.

7
00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:23.838
In NEET, every correct answer awards +4 marks, while every wrong bubble costs a -1 negative mark penalty.

8
00:01:24.088 --> 00:01:35.374
In Guided Practice Mode, clicking 'Check Answer' immediately reveals the exact NCERT textbook reference with step-by-step English and Tamil explanations.

9
00:01:35.624 --> 00:01:45.626
Even better, the '-1 Negative Mark Trap Box' explains why each distractor option fails so you never fall for the same exam trap twice.

10
00:01:45.876 --> 00:01:56.688
Whenever you have a doubt on any question, ask the built-in Gemini AI NEET Coach directly in Tamil, English, or Tanglish.

11
00:01:56.938 --> 00:02:08.320
Use one-tap quick chips for Step-by-Step derivations, Tamil explanations, NCERT memory shortcuts, or a brand-new similar MCQ to test yourself.

12
00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:16.508
It acts like a personal 24/7 NEET subject expert sitting right beside you through every single practice session.

13
00:02:16.758 --> 00:02:29.946
Tab 2 — the Past Papers Archive — houses 40 official NEET, Re-NEET, and classic AIPMT exam papers spanning 27 years from 2000 to 2026.

14
00:02:30.196 --> 00:02:41.650
It also includes official NTA Tamil Medium question booklets from 2018 to 2021 alongside 27-year subject-wise 45-question sprints.

15
00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:52.742
A dedicated module even lets you practice landmark Supreme Court adjudicated questions, +4 bonus dropped items, and multi-key NTA questions.

16
00:02:52.992 --> 00:03:04.116
Beyond past papers, the archive features over 1,430 NCERT Exemplar, Textbook Back-Exercise, and Coaching Mock Test questions.

17
00:03:04.366 --> 00:03:14.572
Practice Class 11 and 12 NCERT Line-by-Line Biology questions complete with exact textbook sentence citations and statement-twist checks.

18
00:03:14.822 --> 00:03:25.880
Full 180-question NTA Abhyas CBT mocks and physics-heavy coaching test packs build the speed needed for tough exam papers.

19
00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:36.798
Tab 3 — the Score and Mentor Tracker — automatically logs every attempt and projects your standing on the 720-point NEET scale.

20
00:03:37.048 --> 00:03:50.230
It benchmarks your score against Tamil Nadu's 85% State Quota and 7.5% Government School Quota cutoffs for MMC, Stanley, Madurai, and District GMCs.

21
00:03:50.480 --> 00:04:00.218
Every wrong answer is saved into your personal Adaptive Mistake Bank so you can re-test weak spots and share a 1-click WhatsApp progress report.

22
00:04:00.468 --> 00:04:12.672
Finally, Tab 4 — the TN NEET Guide & YouTube Hub — shares the exact 3-Round OMR timing playbook used by 720/720 Tamil Nadu toppers.

23
00:04:12.922 --> 00:04:26.752
It also curates the best Tamil and English YouTube tutorials — including Biology Simplified Tamil, Muruga MP, and PW Tamil — linked by subject.

24
00:04:27.002 --> 00:04:38.156
Start practicing today — with 7,484 verified questions, smart OMR analytics, and your bilingual Gemini AI Coach, your medical college dream is within reach!
